\"><strong>本接口支持删除一条营销下存在的素材，请注意</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-KbaghFh9\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QOY5iIoK\">仅支持删除<span style=\"background-color: #fadb14;\">「巨量营销」账户</span>下的营销素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PZx7QNuG\">仅支持删除客户在营销下添加的图片、视频、图文素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9W8fNS2Z\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">不支持</span>删除营销下「已删除」的素材，如传入的material_id在营销下的素材状态为已删除，调用本接口会报错“营销下不存在素材”</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VOCnkhYe\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">不支持</span>将营销下素材全部删除，当营销下仅剩下1个素材时，再调用接口删除素材会报错</li></ul></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201796110113962115%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-FVlKKaD4\" id=\"h346b9f0-FVlKKaD4\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-7IRaaghK\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/promotion/material/delete/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/promotion/material/delete/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1797183832412380\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-8eXmCNaA\" id=\"h346b9f0-8eXmCNaA\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-o9dSeCYb\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-n0eiKOXk\" id=\"h346b9f0-n0eiKOXk\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8Itjtice\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mYMp1ZTY\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-m4mUNT9H\" id=\"h346b9f0-m4mUNT9H\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" s